.TH lprint-shutdown 1 "LPrint" "2026-06-03" "Michael R Sweet"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lprint-shutdown \- stop a running label print server.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B lprint
.B shutdown
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
This command stops a running label print server.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.BR lprint (1),
.BR lprint-server (1).
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
Copyright \[co] 2019-2026 by Michael R Sweet.
